1
00:00:12,429 --> 00:00:13,972
‎Dinginnya!

2
00:00:14,055 --> 00:00:15,682
‎Beginilah rasanya musim gugur.

3
00:00:17,475 --> 00:00:19,978
‎Aku suka momen pergantian musim.

4
00:00:20,061 --> 00:00:21,938
‎Kau sering mengatakan itu.

5
00:00:22,022 --> 00:00:25,191
{\an8}‎Aku suka acara musim panas
‎dengan suasana musim panasnya,

6
00:00:25,275 --> 00:00:28,319
{\an8}‎aku juga suka angin sejuk
‎dengan hawa gerah

7
00:00:28,403 --> 00:00:31,072
{\an8}‎saat berjalan-jalan di malam musim panas…

8
00:00:31,781 --> 00:00:36,202
‎Tapi saat udara mulai sejuk
‎dan musim berganti seperti ini,

9
00:00:36,286 --> 00:00:39,039
‎momen inilah yang membuatku
‎paling bersemangat.

10
00:00:39,122 --> 00:00:41,207
{\an8}‎Sepertinya aku paham maksudmu.

11
00:00:41,291 --> 00:00:44,127
‎Rasanya seperti habis berlatih keras
‎sepanjang musim panas,

12
00:00:44,210 --> 00:00:47,005
‎lalu berpikir, "Apa aku jadi lebih kuat?"

13
00:00:47,088 --> 00:00:51,217
‎Kalau bisa melewati musim panas,
‎kita memang jadi lebih kuat, ya.

14
00:00:51,301 --> 00:00:53,595
‎Maaf, ternyata aku tak paham.

15
00:00:53,678 --> 00:00:54,929
‎Kenapa?

16
00:01:02,020 --> 00:01:03,021
‎Musim gugur.

17
00:01:04,230 --> 00:01:05,940
‎Amamiya, kapan ulang tahunmu?

18
00:01:06,566 --> 00:01:08,485
‎Apa? Mau melakukan sesuatu untukku?

19
00:01:08,568 --> 00:01:10,820
‎Tidak, jangan berharap yang spesial…

20
00:01:11,529 --> 00:01:13,114
{\an8}<i>‎Tanggal 29 September.</i>

21
00:01:14,199 --> 00:01:15,200
{\an8}<i>‎Sebentar lagi.</i>

22
00:01:15,784 --> 00:01:18,119
<i>‎Ulang tahunnya sudah dekat.</i>

23
00:01:18,203 --> 00:01:19,204
<i>‎Tapi…</i>

24
00:01:19,788 --> 00:01:20,789
‎Baik.

25
00:01:21,790 --> 00:01:23,708
{\an8}‎Aku akan menjauhi Amamiya.

26
00:01:24,584 --> 00:01:27,462
<i>‎Aku sudah menjawab dengan sok tegar.</i>

27
00:01:28,296 --> 00:01:30,924
<i>‎Tapi harus sejauh apa?</i>

28
00:01:31,007 --> 00:01:33,176
<i>‎Kami belum membahas batasannya.</i>

29
00:01:33,259 --> 00:01:35,970
<i>‎Apa boleh memberinya hadiah?
‎Tidak, sudah jelas tak boleh.</i>

30
00:01:36,054 --> 00:01:37,055
<i>‎Selamat ulang tahun!</i>

31
00:01:37,889 --> 00:01:40,225
<i>‎Bagaimana kalau kuberikan dengan santai?</i>

32
00:01:40,308 --> 00:01:44,479
<i>‎Tapi aku ingin membalas kebaikannya
‎sebanyak yang pernah dia berikan.</i>

33
00:01:45,855 --> 00:01:50,735
<i>‎Dia tak masuk sekolah akhir pekan ini,
‎aku sedikit mengkhawatirkannya.</i>

34
00:01:51,361 --> 00:01:53,613
<i>‎Aku ingin menanyakan keadaannya,</i>

35
00:01:54,447 --> 00:01:57,075
<i>‎tapi aku tak berhak melakukannya.</i>

36
00:02:01,329 --> 00:02:02,330
‎KELAS 2-2

37
00:02:02,413 --> 00:02:03,706
‎He? Serius?

38
00:02:04,582 --> 00:02:07,001
‎Kau putus dengan Kuriki?

39
00:03:39,552 --> 00:03:43,932
‎EPISODE 22
‎TITIK BALIK

40
00:03:44,599 --> 00:03:47,143
‎BEBERAPA HARI SEBELUMNYA

41
00:03:47,769 --> 00:03:49,395
<i>‎Kau baik-baik saja?</i>

42
00:03:51,731 --> 00:03:54,150
<i>‎Terima kasih.
‎Sekarang sudah baik-baik saja.</i>

43
00:03:58,238 --> 00:04:00,323
‎MAAF, MOMOKA
‎KITA PERLU BICARA

44
00:04:00,406 --> 00:04:01,658
<i>‎Sampai saat ini…</i>

45
00:04:02,617 --> 00:04:03,660
‎Aku mau putus.

46
00:04:04,911 --> 00:04:05,912
‎Baiklah.

47
00:04:07,038 --> 00:04:11,793
{\an8}<i>‎Aku selalu berpikir,
‎"Kalau itu maunya, apa boleh buat."</i>

48
00:04:11,876 --> 00:04:15,213
<i>‎Lebih mudah jika orang lain
‎yang mengambil keputusan.</i>

49
00:04:16,381 --> 00:04:19,008
<i>‎Itu bukan pilihanku,</i>

50
00:04:19,092 --> 00:04:20,969
<i>‎jadi itu bukan kegagalanku.</i>

51
00:04:21,761 --> 00:04:23,179
<i>‎Aku yang dicampakkan,</i>

52
00:04:23,846 --> 00:04:25,640
<i>‎jadi bukan aku yang menyakiti.</i>

53
00:04:26,516 --> 00:04:28,559
<i>‎Selama aku menuruti keinginan orang lain,</i>

54
00:04:29,143 --> 00:04:31,688
<i>‎aku bukan pelaku maupun orang jahat.</i>

55
00:04:32,355 --> 00:04:35,817
<i>‎Aku bersikap begini
‎karena tak mau bertanggung jawab.</i>

56
00:04:36,901 --> 00:04:39,070
{\an8}‎MAAF, MOMOKA
‎KITA PERLU BICARA - DIBACA

57
00:04:39,779 --> 00:04:44,367
<i>‎Ternyata memutuskan hubungan
‎rasanya seberat ini?</i>

58
00:04:45,618 --> 00:04:47,912
‎Kau terlihat santai, padahal baru putus.

59
00:04:48,454 --> 00:04:50,373
‎Tidak sopan. Aku juga merasa terluka.

60
00:04:50,456 --> 00:04:51,666
‎AKU YANG DULU…

61
00:04:54,711 --> 00:04:56,921
<i>‎Aku terlalu sibuk memahami situasi</i>

62
00:04:57,005 --> 00:05:00,550
<i>‎dan melakukan apa yang menurutku
‎orang lain inginkan.</i>

63
00:05:00,633 --> 00:05:03,553
<i>‎Aku sok perhatian
‎demi kepuasan diriku sendiri,</i>

64
00:05:03,636 --> 00:05:06,389
<i>‎lalu menikmatinya
‎saat orang-orang memperhatikanku.</i>

65
00:05:06,889 --> 00:05:08,224
<i>‎"Lihat, tak apa.</i>

66
00:05:08,808 --> 00:05:11,227
<i>‎Aku sudah benar." Begitu pikirku.</i>

67
00:05:12,854 --> 00:05:14,272
<i>‎Padahal kenyataannya…</i>

68
00:05:15,023 --> 00:05:16,274
‎Minato,

69
00:05:17,066 --> 00:05:19,777
‎kau benar-benar tak punya jati diri.

70
00:05:20,862 --> 00:05:22,613
<i>‎Aku seperti cangkang kosong,</i>

71
00:05:23,406 --> 00:05:25,867
<i>‎hanya mengisi diriku dengan orang lain.</i>

72
00:05:27,869 --> 00:05:28,870
<i>‎Aku</i>

73
00:05:29,620 --> 00:05:30,913
<i>‎kacau sekali.</i>

74
00:05:32,874 --> 00:05:34,625
‎MAAF, MOMOKA
‎KITA PERLU BICARA

75
00:05:34,709 --> 00:05:36,294
<i>‎Dia ingin bicara.</i>

76
00:05:36,919 --> 00:05:38,963
<i>‎Begitu dia bilang begitu,</i>

77
00:05:39,714 --> 00:05:42,050
<i>‎aku tahu apa yang ingin dibicarakan.</i>

78
00:05:42,717 --> 00:05:46,763
<i>‎Sejak kami berpacaran,
‎aku makin lama makin gelisah.</i>

79
00:05:50,016 --> 00:05:52,268
<i>‎Sudah cukup hari ini.</i>

80
00:05:53,436 --> 00:05:57,106
<i>‎Sekeras apa pun usahaku,
‎dia tak akan menyadarinya.</i>

81
00:05:58,316 --> 00:06:02,361
<i>‎Hal yang dulu bisa kuusahakan demi diriku,
‎kini tak bisa lagi kuusahakan.</i>

82
00:06:02,862 --> 00:06:05,323
<i>‎Aku jadi cemas kalau tidak diapresiasi.</i>

83
00:06:06,282 --> 00:06:11,579
<i>‎Padahal aku tetap jadi diriku
‎agar tak menjadi cewek yang kubenci,</i>

84
00:06:12,622 --> 00:06:17,293
<i>‎tapi aku malah berubah
‎menjadi sosok yang tak kuinginkan.</i>

85
00:06:19,420 --> 00:06:22,381
<i>‎Rasanya lelah sekali.</i>

86
00:06:35,728 --> 00:06:36,896
‎Kita putus saja.

87
00:06:38,481 --> 00:06:40,858
<i>‎Ya. Sudah kuduga.</i>

88
00:06:41,734 --> 00:06:44,904
‎Kau minta putus
‎karena mau mengejar orang yang kau suka?

89
00:06:46,280 --> 00:06:47,281
‎Tidak.

90
00:06:47,907 --> 00:06:49,242
‎Bukan itu alasannya.

91
00:06:50,618 --> 00:06:52,078
‎Bukan seperti itu.

92
00:06:53,454 --> 00:06:55,039
‎Ada masalah di diriku.

93
00:06:57,208 --> 00:07:00,795
‎Kalau kita terus berpacaran,
‎aku tak akan berubah.

94
00:07:01,712 --> 00:07:04,090
‎Aku tak bisa menjadi seperti yang kau mau.

95
00:07:06,217 --> 00:07:08,052
<i>‎Kurasa aku menyukainya.</i>

96
00:07:08,719 --> 00:07:11,055
<i>‎Aku mau dia bahagia.</i>

97
00:07:12,265 --> 00:07:13,266
<i>‎Tapi…</i>

98
00:07:13,891 --> 00:07:17,603
<i>‎Orang yang membahagiakannya tak harus aku.</i>

99
00:07:19,147 --> 00:07:21,274
<i>‎Aku bukan mau membuatnya bahagia.</i>

100
00:07:21,858 --> 00:07:23,317
<i>‎Aku hanya mau dia bahagia.</i>

101
00:07:24,777 --> 00:07:25,945
‎Perasaan ini

102
00:07:27,155 --> 00:07:28,489
‎bukanlah cinta.

103
00:07:29,824 --> 00:07:30,825
‎Maaf.

104
00:07:35,496 --> 00:07:36,622
‎Itu…

105
00:07:37,290 --> 00:07:39,750
‎Itu sih aku sudah tahu sejak awal!

106
00:07:39,834 --> 00:07:40,835
‎Bodoh!

107
00:07:40,918 --> 00:07:45,089
‎Kau tak menyukaiku,
‎kau cuma merasa punya kewajiban.

108
00:07:45,173 --> 00:07:46,966
‎Aku sudah tahu dari dulu.

109
00:07:47,049 --> 00:07:49,594
‎Dari dulu rasanya menyakitkan!

110
00:07:52,597 --> 00:07:53,598
‎Maaf.

111
00:07:54,223 --> 00:07:55,475
‎Andai kukatakan dari awal…

112
00:07:55,558 --> 00:07:57,977
‎Jangan bilang
‎kau menyesal berpacaran denganku.

113
00:08:00,146 --> 00:08:03,316
‎Jangan menyangkal semuanya seperti itu.

114
00:08:06,903 --> 00:08:11,449
‎Aku lebih suka kau bilang
‎kalau kau menyukai orang lain.

115
00:08:12,492 --> 00:08:14,952
‎Putus karena ada masalah di dirimu.

116
00:08:15,620 --> 00:08:18,623
‎Kau mengambil keputusan sendiri
‎tanpa bicara dulu denganku,

117
00:08:18,706 --> 00:08:22,752
‎itu sama saja kau menganggap
‎aku tak bisa membantu masalahmu.

118
00:08:23,336 --> 00:08:26,506
‎Seolah kau bilang
‎aku bukan orang yang bisa kau percaya.

119
00:08:28,591 --> 00:08:29,592
{\an8}‎Terserah saja.

120
00:08:30,426 --> 00:08:33,137
<i>‎Aku sudah lelah memikirkannya.</i>

121
00:08:34,388 --> 00:08:35,932
<i>‎Terus saja seperti itu.</i>

122
00:08:36,474 --> 00:08:38,518
<i>‎Kunci hatimu selamanya.</i>

123
00:08:44,857 --> 00:08:45,942
‎BUK

124
00:08:47,527 --> 00:08:48,819
‎Baik, aku paham.

125
00:08:49,946 --> 00:08:50,947
‎Kita putus.

126
00:08:52,281 --> 00:08:53,574
‎Bodoh.

127
00:09:03,501 --> 00:09:04,627
<i>‎Selesai.</i>

128
00:09:06,462 --> 00:09:09,382
<i>‎Sudah selesai. Akhirnya selesai.</i>

129
00:09:10,299 --> 00:09:12,718
<i>‎Bohong kalau kubilang aku tak sedih.</i>

130
00:09:13,386 --> 00:09:17,974
<i>‎Tapi jujur, aku juga lega
‎karena tak perlu khawatir lagi.</i>

131
00:09:18,849 --> 00:09:20,810
<i>‎Ya. Tak apa.</i>

132
00:09:21,310 --> 00:09:22,478
<i>‎Syukurlah sudah selesai.</i>

133
00:09:23,062 --> 00:09:24,230
<i>‎Anggap saja begitu.</i>

134
00:09:27,775 --> 00:09:29,735
‎Hapus semua fotonya.

135
00:09:36,325 --> 00:09:39,287
<i>‎Kami mulai berpacaran
‎saat liburan musim panas,</i>

136
00:09:39,370 --> 00:09:42,039
<i>‎jadi sudah sering berkencan
‎dan foto bersama.</i>

137
00:09:45,501 --> 00:09:47,378
<i>‎Dia memang tampan.</i>

138
00:09:47,461 --> 00:09:50,464
{\an8}<i>‎Tidak. Jangan sampai goyah!</i>

139
00:09:52,925 --> 00:09:57,763
{\an8}<i>‎Dia ingat aku pernah bilang
‎kalau aku ingin menonton film ini.</i>

140
00:09:58,556 --> 00:10:00,641
{\an8}<i>‎Dia juga ingat aku ingin ke tempat ini.</i>

141
00:10:03,477 --> 00:10:07,898
<i>‎Dia bahkan rela bergadang menemaniku
‎saat aku bilang ingin menelepon.</i>

142
00:10:08,774 --> 00:10:11,736
<i>‎Padahal momen menyenangkannya
‎jauh lebih banyak.</i>

143
00:10:13,362 --> 00:10:14,655
‎Minato.

144
00:10:15,489 --> 00:10:16,907
‎Apa kau menyukaiku?

145
00:10:17,491 --> 00:10:18,951
{\an8}‎Ya, aku menyukaimu.

146
00:10:19,035 --> 00:10:20,077
{\an8}‎Apa yang kau suka?

147
00:10:20,161 --> 00:10:23,831
{\an8}‎Kau positif, kuat, dan pintar.

148
00:10:23,914 --> 00:10:27,418
{\an8}‎Bukankah itu lebih mirip sindiran
‎daripada pujian untuk cewek?

149
00:10:28,836 --> 00:10:30,296
‎Hati-hati juga ada baiknya.

150
00:10:31,964 --> 00:10:35,551
<i>‎Dari dulu,
‎aku benci diperlakukan seperti boneka.</i>

151
00:10:36,886 --> 00:10:38,721
<i>‎Aku benci dijadikan aksesori</i>

152
00:10:39,430 --> 00:10:43,142
<i>‎atau dinilai seenaknya
‎hanya dari penampilanku.</i>

153
00:10:43,225 --> 00:10:44,560
‎KAU PASTI SUKA INI, MOMOKA

154
00:10:44,644 --> 00:10:45,686
‎WAH, AKU SUKA! HORE!

155
00:10:45,770 --> 00:10:46,771
<i>‎Dia…</i>

156
00:10:47,813 --> 00:10:49,357
<i>‎Dia sungguh memperhatikanku.</i>

157
00:10:49,982 --> 00:10:51,651
<i>‎Dia berusaha mengenalku.</i>

158
00:10:52,818 --> 00:10:54,195
<i>‎Setelah semua itu,</i>

159
00:10:55,988 --> 00:10:57,406
<i>‎pilihannya tetap bukan aku.</i>

160
00:10:59,659 --> 00:11:04,205
<i>‎Kenapa aku baru melihat semua kebaikannya
‎setelah semuanya berakhir?</i>

161
00:11:05,122 --> 00:11:09,335
<i>‎Kenapa saat kami berpacaran,
‎aku tak sadar dia begitu baik?</i>

162
00:11:10,711 --> 00:11:14,924
<i>‎Daripada fokus pada kekurangan
‎dan merasa kecewa,</i>

163
00:11:15,591 --> 00:11:19,595
<i>‎seharusnya aku bersyukur
‎dengan semua perhatian dan kebaikannya.</i>

164
00:11:19,678 --> 00:11:22,098
<i>‎Jika cuma mementingkan diri sendiri,</i>

165
00:11:23,015 --> 00:11:25,101
‎kau hanya akan fokus pada kekuranganmu.

166
00:11:26,227 --> 00:11:28,854
‎Akhirnya, kau tak akan bahagia.

167
00:11:31,690 --> 00:11:35,111
‎PUKUL-PUKUL

168
00:11:38,739 --> 00:11:39,782
‎Mustahil.

169
00:11:39,865 --> 00:11:42,910
‎Bukankah katanya
‎Amamiya yang selalu dicampakkan?

170
00:11:42,993 --> 00:11:44,370
‎Mungkin dia memang selingkuh?

171
00:11:44,453 --> 00:11:46,372
‎Dengan cewek yang di tangga itu?

172
00:11:46,455 --> 00:11:47,873
‎Dasar bajingan.

173
00:11:49,375 --> 00:11:50,459
‎Momoka.

174
00:11:52,253 --> 00:11:53,921
‎Bangunlah. Ayo pulang.

175
00:11:54,004 --> 00:11:55,381
‎Hei, bersemangatlah.

176
00:11:55,464 --> 00:11:57,591
‎Mau beli makanan enak sebelum pulang?

177
00:11:57,675 --> 00:11:59,135
‎Ayo makan sepuasnya.

178
00:11:59,218 --> 00:12:01,887
‎Luapkan saja semuanya.

179
00:12:03,931 --> 00:12:05,141
‎Terima kasih.

180
00:12:05,224 --> 00:12:06,642
‎BAM

181
00:12:08,269 --> 00:12:10,020
‎Agak beda dari bayanganku.

182
00:12:10,104 --> 00:12:11,897
‎BAYANGAN
‎LAMPIASKAN DENGAN MAKAN - TERTAWA

183
00:12:12,898 --> 00:12:13,899
‎Nantinya…

184
00:12:14,608 --> 00:12:18,279
‎Aku akan lebih menyukai diriku
‎dalam hubunganku berikutnya.

185
00:12:19,530 --> 00:12:21,740
‎Aku akan jadi orang yang bisa kusukai,

186
00:12:22,450 --> 00:12:26,412
‎dan mencari cowok yang begitu menyukaiku
‎sampai cuma bisa melihatku.

187
00:12:29,707 --> 00:12:33,127
‎Kalau dia mulai menjauh,
‎akan langsung kucampakkan.

188
00:12:33,919 --> 00:12:35,921
‎Kalau dicampakkan pun, masa bodoh,

189
00:12:36,005 --> 00:12:38,424
‎artinya dia bodoh karena seleranya jelek.

190
00:12:39,425 --> 00:12:42,428
‎Aku akan menjadi cewek seperti itu.

191
00:12:45,681 --> 00:12:46,932
‎Keren sekali.

192
00:12:47,016 --> 00:12:48,017
‎YA!

193
00:12:48,100 --> 00:12:50,394
‎Ide bagus! Semangat!

194
00:12:51,479 --> 00:12:53,564
‎Pedas sekali.

195
00:12:53,647 --> 00:12:56,567
‎Tapi rasanya sangat enak.

196
00:12:56,650 --> 00:12:57,860
‎Semangat!

197
00:12:57,943 --> 00:12:58,944
‎GYOSHO CINA PEDAS

198
00:13:00,654 --> 00:13:03,365
<i>‎Amamiya dan Momoka putus.</i>

199
00:13:03,449 --> 00:13:04,450
‎KELAS 2-2

200
00:13:04,533 --> 00:13:05,868
<i>‎Semuanya terjadi tiba-tiba.</i>

201
00:13:06,827 --> 00:13:10,122
<i>‎Mengingat posisiku,
‎seharusnya aku senang, tapi…</i>

202
00:13:11,165 --> 00:13:15,127
‎Astaga, kondisi Minato kali ini
‎sulit dibuat bercanda.

203
00:13:15,711 --> 00:13:18,380
‎Dia kehilangan semangat hidup
‎sejak kemarin.

204
00:13:18,464 --> 00:13:20,758
‎Hino! Lakukan sesuatu!

205
00:13:20,841 --> 00:13:23,093
‎Aku tak bisa berbuat apa-apa soal ini.

206
00:13:24,261 --> 00:13:25,262
<i>‎Sebelumnya…</i>

207
00:13:25,930 --> 00:13:31,227
‎Meskipun hanya sebentar,
‎aku berterima kasih mereka menyukaiku.

208
00:13:32,186 --> 00:13:35,940
<i>‎Dia terlihat biasa saja setelah putus.</i>

209
00:13:36,440 --> 00:13:39,109
<i>‎Kupikir memang sifatnya begitu, tapi…</i>

210
00:13:40,653 --> 00:13:42,363
‎INTIP

211
00:13:49,537 --> 00:13:52,373
‎Amamiya. Kondisimu sudah tak apa?

212
00:13:53,791 --> 00:13:55,793
‎BENGONG

213
00:13:56,961 --> 00:13:58,921
{\an8}‎Ya, sudah tak apa.

214
00:13:59,713 --> 00:14:00,714
{\an8}‎Terima kasih.

215
00:14:02,049 --> 00:14:04,093
‎Begitu? Syukurlah.

216
00:14:07,221 --> 00:14:08,597
‎Koyun!

217
00:14:08,681 --> 00:14:12,893
‎Hei! Ini sulit sekali!
‎Dia seperti orang yang berbeda.

218
00:14:12,977 --> 00:14:13,978
<i>‎Kami baru saja putus.</i>

219
00:14:14,562 --> 00:14:15,646
{\an8}‎Benar kata Midorikawa.

220
00:14:15,729 --> 00:14:16,730
{\an8}‎TIDAK BISA DIBUAT BERCANDA

221
00:14:17,356 --> 00:14:19,567
‎Aku mau kau menjauhi Minato.

222
00:14:20,484 --> 00:14:23,612
<i>‎Tidak mungkin Momoka yang minta putus.</i>

223
00:14:24,905 --> 00:14:26,198
<i>‎Amamiya yang minta putus?</i>

224
00:14:27,408 --> 00:14:28,701
<i>‎Kalau begitu…</i>

225
00:14:29,285 --> 00:14:31,871
‎Koyuki. Ini kesempatanmu.

226
00:14:31,954 --> 00:14:32,955
‎Tsukko!

227
00:14:33,038 --> 00:14:38,252
{\an8}‎Selagi dia sedih, kalau kau mendekat
‎dan mengisi kekosongan hatinya…

228
00:14:38,335 --> 00:14:40,462
{\an8}‎Ya! Lakukanlah, Koyun.

229
00:14:47,011 --> 00:14:51,348
<i>‎Mengisi kekosongan hatinya
‎mungkin hal yang tepat</i>

230
00:14:51,432 --> 00:14:53,225
<i>‎kalau dia memang sedih setelah putus.</i>

231
00:14:55,311 --> 00:14:57,563
‎Katanya Igarashi dicampakkan oleh Koyuki.

232
00:14:57,646 --> 00:15:00,316
‎Masa? Bukannya hubungan mereka baik?

233
00:15:01,400 --> 00:15:05,070
<i>‎Tapi kalau dia merasa bersalah
‎atau terus menyalahkan diri sendiri,</i>

234
00:15:06,780 --> 00:15:10,576
<i>‎apa yang bisa kulakukan untuk membantunya?</i>

235
00:15:12,786 --> 00:15:15,331
{\an8}‎Amamiya, kau benar putus dengan Kuriki?

236
00:15:15,414 --> 00:15:16,582
‎Ya.

237
00:15:16,665 --> 00:15:19,835
‎Kalau begitu, boleh aku mendekatinya?

238
00:15:19,919 --> 00:15:22,254
‎Apa kau tak nyaman kalau seperti itu?

239
00:15:22,338 --> 00:15:23,589
‎Bukan begitu.

240
00:15:24,590 --> 00:15:27,468
‎Aku tak berhak mengatur hal semacam itu.

241
00:15:27,551 --> 00:15:31,972
‎Tapi kalau kau orangnya,
‎sebentar lagi pasti punya pacar baru.

242
00:15:38,604 --> 00:15:40,272
‎Azumi!

243
00:15:42,191 --> 00:15:43,525
‎Akahoshi?

244
00:15:43,609 --> 00:15:44,944
‎Bagaimana kabar Amamiya?

245
00:15:45,027 --> 00:15:48,030
‎Yah, dia masih murung aneh begitu.

246
00:15:48,113 --> 00:15:49,114
‎Murung aneh, ya?

247
00:15:49,198 --> 00:15:52,368
{\an8}‎Akhir pekan ini, dia ulang tahun.

248
00:15:54,453 --> 00:15:55,829
{\an8}‎Benarkah?

249
00:15:55,913 --> 00:15:57,247
{\an8}‎Lupa, ya?

250
00:15:57,748 --> 00:15:59,124
{\an8}‎Kasihan Amamiya.

251
00:15:59,208 --> 00:16:02,211
‎Karena ini ulang tahunnya,
‎aku ingin melakukan sesuatu,

252
00:16:02,294 --> 00:16:04,380
‎tapi aku tak pandai dalam hal begini.

253
00:16:04,463 --> 00:16:07,132
{\an8}‎Wah. Ide bagus!

254
00:16:07,216 --> 00:16:09,885
‎- Ini pasti bisa menghiburnya.
‎- Benar, 'kan?

255
00:16:10,469 --> 00:16:12,721
‎Kalau begitu,
‎sekalian kita buat lucu saja.

256
00:16:12,805 --> 00:16:14,682
‎- Setuju.
‎- Ada apa ini?

257
00:16:14,765 --> 00:16:15,766
‎MIDORIKAWA BERGABUNG!!

258
00:16:17,685 --> 00:16:18,894
‎Dan begitulah…

259
00:16:19,853 --> 00:16:21,146
‎RENCANA KEJUTAN
‎ULANG TAHUN AMAMIYA

260
00:16:21,230 --> 00:16:22,815
‎Rencana kejutan ulang tahun!

261
00:16:23,857 --> 00:16:26,735
‎Ayo beli barang-barang
‎yang bisa digunakan.

262
00:16:26,819 --> 00:16:28,028
‎Ya!

263
00:16:28,112 --> 00:16:29,947
‎Mau beli untuk Minato juga?

264
00:16:30,030 --> 00:16:31,490
‎- Kalau ini?
‎- Tidak perlu.

265
00:16:31,573 --> 00:16:34,034
‎HAHAHA

266
00:16:35,411 --> 00:16:37,538
‎Kalian tak ada kegiatan klub hari ini?

267
00:16:37,621 --> 00:16:41,000
‎Setelah festival budaya selesai,
‎ini masanya bersantai.

268
00:16:41,083 --> 00:16:44,336
‎Klub band juga cuma melakukan
‎kegiatan masing-masing.

269
00:16:49,216 --> 00:16:50,843
‎Yota bilang klubnya sudah selesai.

270
00:16:50,926 --> 00:16:51,927
‎Boleh kuajak?

271
00:16:54,471 --> 00:16:56,181
<i>‎Bikin kaget saja.</i>

272
00:16:56,807 --> 00:17:00,561
<i>‎Tapi aku tak perlu gugup terus
‎saat bersamanya, 'kan?</i>

273
00:17:01,145 --> 00:17:03,564
<i>‎Dia juga sudah melupakannya.</i>

274
00:17:03,647 --> 00:17:05,065
<i>‎Itu sudah berlalu.</i>

275
00:17:05,149 --> 00:17:08,819
{\an8}<i>‎Justru aneh dan tidak sopan
‎kalau aku terus membesar-besarkannya.</i>

276
00:17:12,781 --> 00:17:14,199
‎BAM

277
00:17:14,283 --> 00:17:16,368
<i>‎Kurasa begitu…</i>

278
00:17:16,452 --> 00:17:17,453
‎DEG DEG DEG
‎SERUPUT

279
00:17:17,536 --> 00:17:22,833
{\an8}<i>‎Yota selama ini hanya memikirkan
‎cara membuatmu bahagia.</i>

280
00:17:23,459 --> 00:17:26,462
<i>‎Dia tak pernah berpikir
‎untuk dibahagiakan olehmu.</i>

281
00:17:27,212 --> 00:17:30,257
{\an8}‎Bagiku, kau adalah Miki.

282
00:17:32,843 --> 00:17:35,345
<i>‎Hentikan! Jangan ingat itu sekarang!</i>

283
00:17:35,429 --> 00:17:37,389
‎Yota makan banyak sekali.

284
00:17:39,850 --> 00:17:41,560
‎Kalau begitu, kami lewat sini.

285
00:17:43,353 --> 00:17:44,980
‎Oh, begitu, ya?

286
00:17:45,064 --> 00:17:47,983
‎- Dah.
‎- Sampai jumpa besok!

287
00:17:49,777 --> 00:17:52,071
‎Kalau begitu, ayo pulang.
‎Bareng setengah jalan.

288
00:17:52,154 --> 00:17:53,655
‎Ya…

289
00:18:03,082 --> 00:18:05,250
<i>‎Wah, cuma kami berdua.</i>

290
00:18:05,334 --> 00:18:06,502
<i>‎Wah…</i>

291
00:18:07,377 --> 00:18:09,254
<i>‎Bagaimana ini?</i>

292
00:18:09,922 --> 00:18:13,133
<i>‎Aku tak suka ini.
‎Aku tak suka perasaan seperti ini.</i>

293
00:18:13,967 --> 00:18:16,470
<i>‎Seolah-olah cuma aku yang aneh.</i>

294
00:18:17,096 --> 00:18:19,014
<i>‎Rasanya aku tak bisa bersikap biasa.</i>

295
00:18:21,350 --> 00:18:23,894
<i>‎Padahal dulu baik-baik saja.</i>

296
00:18:31,068 --> 00:18:33,112
‎- Kucing?
‎- Di mana?

297
00:18:33,195 --> 00:18:35,405
‎Tadi sepertinya aku melihat hewan.

298
00:18:36,073 --> 00:18:37,449
‎Ayo coba lihat.

299
00:18:37,533 --> 00:18:40,327
‎Tadi apa, ya?
‎Gawat, aku malah jadi semangat.

300
00:18:40,410 --> 00:18:42,037
‎Bagaimana kalau itu <i>‎tsuchinoko?</i>

301
00:18:44,832 --> 00:18:46,125
‎Lihat! Itu dia!

302
00:18:47,292 --> 00:18:49,169
‎TATAP…

303
00:18:49,253 --> 00:18:51,672
‎Yota, apa minus lensamu perlu ditambah?

304
00:18:51,755 --> 00:18:52,923
‎MENGENDAP-ENDAP

305
00:18:53,006 --> 00:18:54,174
‎Satu, dua…

306
00:18:54,258 --> 00:18:55,551
‎WUS

307
00:18:55,634 --> 00:18:58,387
‎MELAYANG

308
00:18:58,470 --> 00:19:00,055
‎GULMA GELINDING

309
00:19:03,142 --> 00:19:04,143
{\an8}‎Apa itu?

310
00:19:08,981 --> 00:19:10,691
{\an8}‎Tidak… Eh?

311
00:19:10,774 --> 00:19:13,235
‎Aku yakin sekali tadi itu hidup.

312
00:19:13,318 --> 00:19:14,444
‎Ini?

313
00:19:14,528 --> 00:19:15,529
‎MELAYANG

314
00:19:17,781 --> 00:19:19,199
‎Benda apa ini?

315
00:19:19,283 --> 00:19:20,576
‎Jangan tanya aku!

316
00:19:20,659 --> 00:19:23,203
<i>‎Kukira ini cuma ada di film koboi.</i>

317
00:19:24,163 --> 00:19:25,164
‎ELUS-ELUS

318
00:19:25,247 --> 00:19:27,583
‎Aku malah jadi menyukainya. Anak pintar.

319
00:19:36,049 --> 00:19:37,593
<i>‎Sudah kuduga.</i>

320
00:19:39,428 --> 00:19:41,305
<i>‎Aku suka menghabiskan waktu bersama Yota.</i>

321
00:19:43,557 --> 00:19:45,726
<i>‎Aku suka diriku saat bersamanya.</i>

322
00:19:47,728 --> 00:19:49,271
<i>‎Aku suka Yota.</i>

323
00:19:51,356 --> 00:19:53,692
<i>‎Bukan sekadar cinta atau teman.</i>

324
00:19:54,359 --> 00:19:55,819
<i>‎Aku suka dia sebagai manusia.</i>

325
00:19:57,404 --> 00:19:59,281
<i>‎Padahal ini hal yang sederhana.</i>

326
00:20:00,073 --> 00:20:02,367
<i>‎Memang begini seharusnya dari dulu.</i>

327
00:20:02,993 --> 00:20:06,705
<i>‎Kenapa sekarang
‎aku malah terlalu memikirkannya?</i>

328
00:20:08,457 --> 00:20:10,792
‎Astaga, lucu sekali.

329
00:20:10,876 --> 00:20:11,877
‎Ayo pulang.

330
00:20:13,587 --> 00:20:15,130
‎Dah, Pokojiro.

331
00:20:15,214 --> 00:20:16,381
‎Adiknya Pokota?

332
00:20:18,717 --> 00:20:20,552
‎Hup, hup…

333
00:20:20,636 --> 00:20:22,304
‎Naiknya lumayan menguras tenaga.

334
00:20:22,387 --> 00:20:23,388
‎Benar.

335
00:20:27,935 --> 00:20:28,936
‎Aman.

336
00:20:30,938 --> 00:20:33,106
‎Kau baik-baik saja? Hati-hati.

337
00:20:33,190 --> 00:20:34,358
‎Ya.

338
00:20:34,983 --> 00:20:36,360
‎Terima kasih.

339
00:20:41,865 --> 00:20:42,866
‎Satu, dua…

340
00:20:42,950 --> 00:20:44,368
‎Hup!

341
00:20:45,869 --> 00:20:47,454
‎Tadi aku lengah.

342
00:20:47,537 --> 00:20:48,997
‎Coba fokus.

343
00:20:49,581 --> 00:20:52,000
<i>‎Jangan terlalu dipikirkan.</i>

344
00:20:52,084 --> 00:20:53,752
<i>‎Biasa saja.</i>

345
00:21:00,842 --> 00:21:02,511
{\an8}<i>‎- Anginnya…</i>
‎- Oh.

346
00:21:03,178 --> 00:21:04,596
‎Aku suka angin begini.

347
00:21:07,224 --> 00:21:08,558
‎Sebentar lagi musim gugur.

348
00:21:09,768 --> 00:21:11,353
‎Rasanya jadi bersemangat, ya?

349
00:21:11,895 --> 00:21:16,441
‎Tapi saat udara mulai sejuk
‎dan musim berganti seperti ini,

350
00:21:16,525 --> 00:21:18,777
‎momen inilah yang membuatku
‎paling bersemangat.

351
00:21:21,613 --> 00:21:22,614
<i>‎Tidak bisa.</i>

352
00:21:24,491 --> 00:21:26,994
<i>‎Sudah tak bisa lagi.</i>

353
00:21:27,995 --> 00:21:31,790
<i>‎Eh, mustahil. Eh?</i>

354
00:21:31,873 --> 00:21:34,126
<i>‎Tidak. Mustahil.</i>

355
00:21:36,420 --> 00:21:38,088
‎Sampai jumpa besok.

356
00:22:00,068 --> 00:22:03,405
<i>‎Senyumku belum hilang sejak keseruan tadi.</i>

357
00:22:04,948 --> 00:22:10,746
<i>‎Langkah kakiku terasa ringan
‎karena perasaan semangat dan gugup.</i>

358
00:22:11,705 --> 00:22:14,374
<i>‎Meski begitu, hatiku terasa sesak.</i>

359
00:22:14,958 --> 00:22:16,251
<i>‎Sampai mau menangis.</i>

360
00:22:16,960 --> 00:22:19,421
<i>‎Bagaimana ini?</i>

361
00:22:20,422 --> 00:22:22,883
<i>‎Sederhananya, ini cinta.</i>

362
00:23:50,929 --> 00:23:55,934
{\an8}‎Terjemahan subtitle oleh Shoffanny R

